<a class="back-link" href="/money/invoices/<%= document.row.id %>">‹ Invoice</a><h1>Email invoice <%= document.row.invoice_number %></h1>
<section class="card"><div class="card-body"><p>Send the invoice PDF from <strong><%= document.issuer %></strong> to <strong><%= document.customer.name %></strong> at <strong><%= document.customer.email||'No email address saved' %></strong>.</p><p>Total: <%= helpers.money(document.row.total_minor,document.row.currency) %> · Due <%= document.dueDate %>.</p><p><a href="/money/invoices/<%= document.row.id %>/pdf">Download the PDF to review</a> · <a href="/money/invoices/<%= document.row.id %>/print" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Print preview</a></p>
<% if(!emailConfigured){ %><p class="notice notice--warn">Invoice email delivery is not connected yet. You can download or print the invoice now.</p><% } %>
<% if(!document.customer.email){ %><p>Add the customer’s email in <a href="/sales/customers/<%= document.row.customer_id %>">customer details</a>.</p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/money/invoices/<%= document.row.id %>/email"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="expectedHash" value="<%= document.hash %>"><input type="hidden" name="requestKey" value="<%= requestKey %>"><p>Uses one email from your allowance after delivery is accepted. No stock, invoice amount, or payment changes.</p><button class="btn btn--primary" <%= emailConfigured&&document.customer.email&&!['VOID','DRAFT'].includes(document.row.status)?'':'disabled' %>>Confirm and email invoice</button></form></div></section>
